  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a molcajete or grill pan to medium-high heat.",
    "Combine lamb mince, onion, garlic, cumin seeds, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper in a large bowl.",
    "Mix in flour, breadcrumbs, and egg until just combined.",
    "Divide the mixture into 4 equal portions and shape into patties.",
    "Add patties to the preheated pan and cook for 4-5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, toast sesame seed buns on the pan or in a toaster.",
    "Assemble burgers by spreading a layer of tahini sauce on the bottom bun, followed by a cooked patty, lettuce, tomato, and finally the top bun.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
